        <ul class="list-unstyled d-flex flex-wrap gap-3 mb-0">
          <li><span class="wg-badge wg-a">(a)</span> Formal models</li>
          <li><span class="wg-badge wg-b">(b)</span> Query, storage &amp; indexing</li>
          <li><span class="wg-badge wg-c">(c)</span> Benchmarks &amp; use cases</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

